// Rule 3 - Execution of a double-extension binary from user-writable paths
// Tactic: Defense Evasion (T1036.003) / Execution (T1204.002)
// Proposed severity: HIGH (risk_score 73)
// Status: PROPOSAL - highest false-positive risk of the set. Tune the regex
// against a real software inventory before enforcing.
process where event.type == "start"
  and process.executable : (
        "C:\\Users\\*\\Downloads\\*",
        "C:\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*",
        "C:\\$Recycle.Bin\\*")
  and process.name regex~ """.*\.(pdf|doc|docx|xls|xlsx|jpg|png|txt|zip)\.(exe|scr|bat|cmd|js)"""
